            <description><![CDATA[<h2>SleekDemo 2.9.0</h2>
<p>A record shortcut, a cleaner desktop, smarter camera, and a loupe.</p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>⇧⌘2</strong> starts or stops a recording from any app.</li>
  <li><strong>Clean desktop</strong>: desktop icons and widgets stay out of your recordings.</li>
  <li><strong>Exact window sizes</strong> before you record, and exports copied to your clipboard.</li>
  <li><strong>Keep Me Centred</strong>, <strong>Hide While I'm Not Talking</strong>, and camera looks.</li>
  <li><strong>Loupe</strong>: magnify one spot instead of zooming the whole screen.</li>
  <li><strong>Reel preview</strong> and a proper <strong>iPad</strong> frame.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
