            <description><![CDATA[<h2>SleekDemo 2.8.0</h2>
<p>Hide what's private, even when you zoom in.</p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Blur that stays put</strong>: blur, mosaic and spotlight boxes now stick to your screen, so zooms and pans never reveal what they hide.</li>
  <li><strong>Blur button</strong>: hide an email, a key or a notification in one click from the timeline.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
